scope every command SOURCE.md and manual/ print was run rather than read; eleven repaired; the guard widened by four clauses and each proven both ways
status GREEN -- docs_command_path GREEN with moved_living=0, control 17 of 17. ascii_document, tracked_link, shell_dialect, phantom_path, exec_bit, spoken_ascii and living_docs_lint all GREEN after the change. Every page and guard touched grades B or better. The cold open was launched at the lap's open and its verdict is named in the send.
recommend keep-going -- the same taste one room further out: SOURCE.md's own setup commands were read this lap and only partly run, since several provision hosts and cross custody gates; the honest next lap runs the ones that touch no gate and names the ones that do, so the front door a newcomer meets is proven rather than assumed
